#edb/ref 17592186429909 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186429911 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186429913 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186429915 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186429924 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429929 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429929 1077 "selection" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429929 1078 #edb/ref 17592186429909 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429929 1079 #uuid "f070068b-56d2-50d4-88fa-ab05a0ca7204" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429930 1068 #edb/ref 17592186429926 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429930 1069 "q-113997" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429930 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429930 1071 "Calculate $\\int \\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429930 1072 #uuid "305ab7d8-b9f8-5861-8b01-dd9a503b80df" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429930 1074 "Let $u=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}={sec}^{2}⁡x\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u={sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1}\\cdot {sec}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1}\\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\cdot {sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}(u-1)\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\int (1-\\frac{1}{u})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =u-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1|+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1|+K\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=C+1.$" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429931 1068 #edb/ref 17592186429928 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429931 1069 "q-355818" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429931 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429931 1071 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /20}^{\\pi /10}5{csc}^{2}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429931 1072 #uuid "66f3c3b9-c1e9-58f7-9604-16a02027760f" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429931 1074 "If we let $u=5x,$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $\\pi /20$ | $\\pi /10$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\pi /4$ | $\\pi /2$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /20}^{\\pi /10}5{csc}^{2}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}5{csc}^{2}⁡(u)\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}{csc}^{2}⁡(u)\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(u){|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-(\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})) \\\\  & =-(0-1) \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429932 1068 #edb/ref 17592186429927 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429932 1069 "q-10574" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429932 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429932 1071 "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /9}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429932 1072 #uuid "a41efe2e-217f-5d4e-8c40-c317692d2ec6" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429932 1074 "If we let $u=3x+\\frac{\\pi }{3},$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\pi /9$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\pi /3$ | $2\\pi /3$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /9}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{2\\pi /3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{2\\pi /3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u{|}_{\\pi /3}^{2\\pi /3} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}(-\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429933 1068 #edb/ref 17592186429929 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429933 1069 "q-10578" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429933 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429933 1071 "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sec}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{tan}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429933 1072 #uuid "a6be6fa7-2d6e-5c8a-ab1e-bb035341f649" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true] [17592186429933 1074 "If we let $u=x-\\frac{\\pi }{3},$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives \n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\pi /2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $-\\pi /3$ | $\\pi /6$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sec}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{tan}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-\\pi /3}^{\\pi /6}\\operatorname{sec}⁡u\\operatorname{tan}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡u{|}_{-\\pi /3}^{\\pi /6} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(-\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}-2\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534625 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-02192a18-96df-5c9c-86d1-fd39f10cc96d" 17592186429909 "answer-027cbe6b-cc9e-5232-a368-f7d9b5981f38" 17592186429910 "answer-258b40a9-d7f7-5e38-ab76-8707b1a1a9b7" 17592186429911 "answer-4952b9e8-bbdc-5ebd-87ec-3e2a8e0abe98" 17592186429912 "answer-59c2d43f-3033-53cf-a498-afe18808b478" 17592186429913 "answer-5e5262af-da0e-5a59-8704-7c9dacf4de2f" 17592186429914 "answer-605c38a6-bd94-5054-abeb-196bc585d8b9" 17592186429915 "answer-9f63075a-1c8a-5a7b-92d3-a38ee960a89e" 17592186429916 "answer-9fd0f034-ce27-5ace-8026-4eaf6cb1ce68" 17592186429917 "answer-bde6a22f-af92-5d05-a00e-ee43025b38b1" 17592186429918 "answer-bf2617d8-6d99-5cd0-a36b-cb5a85fa00c5" 17592186429919 "answer-c99d3fe5-21ad-5042-83f6-cbfa8e3c7e98" 17592186429920 "answer-d0f5b679-6496-55a2-9c95-8d9e7d1b6239" 17592186429921 "answer-d6fa740d-7171-561d-a05a-6cdf9a71c7c4" 17592186429922 "answer-f18bdd3d-8085-5e2e-822e-62d75b040c5c" 17592186429923 "answer-f513628d-4c08-512b-85ac-0d46df6f115b" 17592186429924 "answer-f602ed78-2e15-5cdc-81a3-3dc36a33f074" 17592186429925 "answer-field-5edcce3e-e53a-5f19-ab28-fc88ce15b3a5" 17592186429926 "answer-field-bcc8d1e8-f376-53d7-9c0f-65db14888af4" 17592186429927 "answer-field-e4b1c21c-bb6c-5c53-b4e6-f6635e6c2be4" 17592186429928 "answer-field-f070068b-56d2-50d4-88fa-ab05a0ca7204" 17592186429929 "question-305ab7d8-b9f8-5861-8b01-dd9a503b80df" 17592186429930 "question-66f3c3b9-c1e9-58f7-9604-16a02027760f" 17592186429931 "question-a41efe2e-217f-5d4e-8c40-c317692d2ec6" 17592186429932 "question-a6be6fa7-2d6e-5c8a-ab1e-bb035341f649" 17592186429933}}
